Six rows, one per low-level leg:

(a-f) EC flux and the five estimates (T-Bird bulk, ERA5-MODIS bulk, ERA5-only bulk,
ERA5 and CARRA model-diagnosed) along the leg, reference configuration;

(g-l) MODIS Terra ice-surface temperature of the day (NASA GIBS) with the flight track;

(m-r) MODIS Terra true-colour image of the same area, the track coloured by the EC flux.

The GIBS images are downloaded once and cached in figures_manuscript/_gibs_cache/.

(a) H_S,obs,bulk against H_S,obs,EC;

(b) histograms of the EC, T-Bird bulk and ERA5-MODIS bulk fluxes;

(c) H_S,RS,bulk against H_S,obs,EC;

(d) histograms of the EC flux and the reanalysis-driven estimates.

Scatter points are coloured by the bulk Richardson number; the error bars are the
1-sigma uncertainties of Table 2 (

fluxpy.uncertainty). The regression slope b,
correlation r and bias are printed for the caption. All fluxes are positive
upward; the model-diagnosed fluxes are already stored with this sign.
